Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Inverse-lengthscale parameterized cov_exp_quad()?
Message-ID: <vZREaewjQRw.IfgzstzgAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <vZREaewjQRw.fHBdA27KAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <vZREaewjQRw.PO4a7aH_BgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <vZREaewjQRw.fHBdA27KAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
