From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Thu Sep  8 14:58:23 2016
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 08 Sep 2016 14:58:23 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Variables declared in model block not saved?
Message-ID: <rG5_BZoqrUk.UWEj20frAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <rG5_BZoqrUk.txVFwYkDBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <rG5_BZoqrUk.txVFwYkDBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
