Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Variables declared in model block not saved?
Message-ID: <rG5_BZoqrUk.F6xBkj2pAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <rG5_BZoqrUk.ZglKtd1dAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <rG5_BZoqrUk.txVFwYkDBwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <rG5_BZoqrUk.ZglKtd1dAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
