Subject: Two data and two likelihood in a Stan model: Is it possible?
Message-ID: <i6y5Kzn1z6A.52PET6jqAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/i6y5Kzn1z6A/m/52PET6jqAgAJ>
