Subject: Right-censorship and marginalization of joint distribution for custom likelihood
Message-ID: <E342-2iXYHA.IuuBwLb0AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/E342-2iXYHA/m/IuuBwLb0AwAJ>
