Subject: Re: [stan-users] Biased parameters for truncated, noisy data
Message-ID: <-1xspC9n_dE.x8s11qH8AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <-1xspC9n_dE.1Xd5Lv04AgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <-1xspC9n_dE.q3z8RtGfBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <-1xspC9n_dE.1Xd5Lv04AgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
