On Thursday, September 15, 2016 at 7:43:29 PM UTC-4, Daniel Lee wrote:
> Example:
> parameters {
>   simplex[3] x;
> }
> model {
> }
>
> fit <- stan("example.stan")
>
> I guess I'm looking for something like:
>
> x_draws <- extract(fit, ...)
>
> where x[1], x[2], ... might be a 3-vectors.
>
> Or some other way to do something like that.

extract(fit, pars = "x")

yields an iterations x chains x 3 array. Is that what you are looking for?

Ben

