Subject: Re: [stan-users] Using init values with ADVI (vb) or BFGS (optimizing) to compute a regularization path
Message-ID: <R0CC91MElFY.Z3FiLCtZBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <R0CC91MElFY.jSZMYVdRBgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
