Subject: Efficient way to compute distance in rstan
Message-ID: <C2mA47pOL4w.1qrYg0ChBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/C2mA47pOL4w/m/1qrYg0ChBQAJ>
