If there's lots of parameters and lots of iterations, the resulting stan_fit object might be fairly large to keep in memory, so you could simply save each stan_fit to file ("save(my_stanfit,file=paste(c(sim_iteration,".rdata"),sep=""))") then delete the stan_fit object from the environment ("rm(my_stanfit)") before re-running the model on new simulated data.

